<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Samples on MCP Toolbox for Databases</title><link>https://mcp-toolbox.dev/integrations/bigquery/samples/</link><description>Recent content in Samples on MCP Toolbox for Databases</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://mcp-toolbox.dev/integrations/bigquery/samples/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Quickstart (Local with BigQuery)</title><link>https://mcp-toolbox.dev/integrations/bigquery/samples/local_quickstart/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mcp-toolbox.dev/integrations/bigquery/samples/local_quickstart/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://colab.research.google.com/github/googleapis/mcp-toolbox/blob/main/docs/en/samples/bigquery/colab_quickstart_bigquery.ipynb"&gt;&lt;img src="https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg" alt="Open In&#10;Colab"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="before-you-begin"&gt;Before you begin&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This guide assumes you have already done the following:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Installed &lt;a href="https://wiki.python.org/moin/BeginnersGuide/Download"&gt;Python 3.10+&lt;/a&gt; (including &lt;a href="https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/installation/"&gt;pip&lt;/a&gt; and&#10;your preferred virtual environment tool for managing dependencies e.g.&#10;&lt;a href="https://packaging.python.org/en/latest/tutorials/installing-packages/#creating-virtual-environments"&gt;venv&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Installed and configured the &lt;a href="https://cloud.google.com/sdk/docs/install"&gt;Google Cloud SDK (gcloud CLI)&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Authenticated with Google Cloud for Application Default Credentials (ADC):&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;gcloud auth login --update-adc&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Set your default Google Cloud project (replace &lt;code&gt;YOUR_PROJECT_ID&lt;/code&gt; with your&#10;actual project ID):&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;gcloud config &lt;span class="nb"&gt;set&lt;/span&gt; project YOUR_PROJECT_ID&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;YOUR_PROJECT_ID&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Toolbox and the client libraries will use this project for BigQuery, unless&#10;overridden in configurations.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/quickstarts/query-public-dataset-console#before-you-begin"&gt;Enabled the BigQuery API&lt;/a&gt; in your Google Cloud project.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Installed the BigQuery client library for Python:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;pip install google-cloud-bigquery&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Completed setup for usage with an LLM model such as&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="tabs-0" role="tablist"&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link active"&#10; id="tabs-00-00-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-00" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="core" aria-controls="tabs-00-00" aria-selected="true"&gt;&#10; Core&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link"&#10; id="tabs-00-01-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-01" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="langchain" aria-controls="tabs-00-01" aria-selected="false"&gt;&#10; LangChain&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link"&#10; id="tabs-00-02-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-02" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="llamaindex" aria-controls="tabs-00-02" aria-selected="false"&gt;&#10; LlamaIndex&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="nav-link"&#10; id="tabs-00-03-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-03" role="tab"&#10; data-td-tp-persist="adk" aria-controls="tabs-00-03" aria-selected="false"&gt;&#10; ADK&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="tab-content" id="tabs-0-content"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade show active"&#10; id="tabs-00-00" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-00-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://python.langchain.com/docs/integrations/llms/google_vertex_ai_palm/#setup"&gt;langchain-vertexai&lt;/a&gt;&#10;package.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://python.langchain.com/docs/integrations/chat/google_generative_ai/#setup"&gt;langchain-google-genai&lt;/a&gt;&#10;package.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://python.langchain.com/docs/integrations/chat/anthropic/#setup"&gt;langchain-anthropic&lt;/a&gt;&#10;package.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"&#10; id="tabs-00-01" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-01-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://python.langchain.com/docs/integrations/llms/google_vertex_ai_palm/#setup"&gt;langchain-vertexai&lt;/a&gt;&#10;package.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://python.langchain.com/docs/integrations/chat/google_generative_ai/#setup"&gt;langchain-google-genai&lt;/a&gt;&#10;package.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://python.langchain.com/docs/integrations/chat/anthropic/#setup"&gt;langchain-anthropic&lt;/a&gt;&#10;package.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"&#10; id="tabs-00-02" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-02-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://pypi.org/project/llama-index-llms-google-genai/"&gt;llama-index-llms-google-genai&lt;/a&gt;&#10;package.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.llamaindex.ai/en/stable/examples/llm/anthropic"&gt;llama-index-llms-anthropic&lt;/a&gt;&#10;package.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"&#10; id="tabs-00-03" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-03-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;&#10; &lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://pypi.org/project/google-adk/"&gt;google-adk&lt;/a&gt; package.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>